guarantee: AC-1: text that is not schema 1 is refused (the probe's parse error swallowed)
file: crates/voicen-core/src/call/transcript.rs
added_by: test-writer
equivalent: every text the probe cannot read also fails the full parse (a `schema` that is not an i64 is not a u32 either), so the last line returns the same Malformed
--- old
let probe: SchemaProbe =
            serde_json::from_str(text).map_err(|_| TranscriptParseError::Malformed)?;
--- new
let probe: SchemaProbe =
            serde_json::from_str(text).unwrap_or(SchemaProbe { schema: 1 });
--- end
